            <description>
                <summary>
                    Hardware-accelerated smooth LED brightness and color-temperature control using GPT PWM outputs, GPT periodic timers, DMAC transfers, and ELC event chaining. Supports smooth transitions between predefined brightness levels while minimizing CPU utilization.
                </summary>
            </description>

